      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process was seamless, with an on-site visit and lots of info to assist with our decision making. We ended up choosing a slightly more expensive quote so that we could work with a local business (given issues with getting tradies to a semi-rural area), which turned out to be a good idea. We know we can reach out to our supplier, who's based in the next town, should we have any issues.Installation was efficient. Trades people were knowledgable, helpful and did a really neat job. They arranged for inspection and certification which occurred promptly, and the system passed with flying colours.Customer service was good. All enquiries were answered promptly, and we were kept informed of plans, dates etc.I'd have no hesitation in recommending Metrical Energy.",
